 role between the living and God via royal ancestors. Mediums led prayers for rain, they installed chiefs and were instrumental in dethroning incompetent chiefs. This separation of powers between religious leaders and chiefs was an important balancing act.”  '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 869, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 770})
